1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,611
Need a landing page that
turns visitors into bookings?

2
00:00:03,611 --> 00:00:07,702
Let's build one from a template, and
publish it, in just a few minutes.

3
00:00:08,554 --> 00:00:10,343
In Sites, click New Funnel.

4
00:00:10,343 --> 00:00:15,908
Start from a blank page, a ready-made
template, or let Funnels AI draft one for you.

5
00:00:16,758 --> 00:00:17,930
Choose a category.

6
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:22,359
There are designs for dental and
health practices, local businesses,

7
00:00:22,359 --> 00:00:23,661
and lead generation.

8
00:00:23,661 --> 00:00:26,136
This dental template is a great start.

9
00:00:26,987 --> 00:00:31,275
Preview it on mobile too, because that's
where many of your visitors will see it.

10
00:00:31,275 --> 00:00:33,604
Then click Use, and
give your funnel a name.

11
00:00:36,883 --> 00:00:41,072
Instantly, you have a three-step
funnel: an opt-in page, a booking page,

12
00:00:41,072 --> 00:00:42,294
and a thank-you page.

13
00:00:42,294 --> 00:00:43,632
Let's open the builder.

14
00:00:44,496 --> 00:00:45,971
Click anything to edit it.

15
00:00:45,971 --> 00:00:50,623
Add your business name, then write a
headline that says exactly what visitors get.

16
00:00:51,423 --> 00:00:53,801
Change the button colour
to match your brand,

17
00:00:53,801 --> 00:00:55,863
and swap the photo for one of your own.

18
00:00:56,663 --> 00:00:58,194
Click Save, then Publish.

19
00:00:58,194 --> 00:01:00,214
And that's it: your page is live.

20
00:01:01,688 --> 00:01:06,813
Give it a clean web address, and share
it in your ads, emails and social posts.

21
00:01:06,813 --> 00:01:10,380
Every form fill lands in your
CRM, ready for follow-up.

22
00:01:11,198 --> 00:01:12,643
Then watch the results.

23
00:01:12,643 --> 00:01:16,725
Kyntlo tracks views, opt-ins and
conversion rates for every step,

24
00:01:16,725 --> 00:01:18,923
so you know exactly what's working.

25
00:01:19,773 --> 00:01:24,184
Funnels, pages, forms and surveys
are included in every Kyntlo plan,

26
00:01:24,184 --> 00:01:25,611
starting with Starter.

27
00:01:26,461 --> 00:01:29,939
Your next landing page is
just a few minutes away.

28
00:01:29,939 --> 00:01:33,347
Start your free 14-day
trial today, at kyntlo.ai.
